00:03:44.862 --> 00:03:46.688
but you have to be a productive person.

00:03:46.688 --> 00:03:48.337
- I do actually feel better.

00:03:48.337 --> 00:03:50.083
- I don't feel as like fuck,

00:03:50.083 --> 00:03:52.454
