has subsided quite a bit.

00:03:52.454 --> 00:03:53.376
- [Both] Gensing tea.

00:03:53.376 --> 00:03:54.366
- That was really good.

00:03:54.366 --> 00:03:55.326
- Yeah I think that was my favorite,

00:03:55.326 --> 00:03:56.351
I could see how that does the trick.

00:03:56.351 --> 00:04:00.448
- I would order that Korean
soup any day of the week.

00:04:00.448 --> 00:04:01.822
- That's the best one, that was my vote.

00:04:01.822 --> 00:04:06.217
- This is lovely. I recommend
a five course hangover cure.

00:04:06.217 --> 00:04:08.424
- Honestly, I'm starting to feel better,

00:04:08.424 --> 00:04:10.507
this is actually working.

00:04:11.666 --> 00:04:14.833
(light playful music)

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:19.247
